1
00:00:00,016 --> 00:00:04,022
Sri Lanka Smart Lost & Found · Isolated demo with synthetic reports

2
00:00:04,022 --> 00:00:11,246
Finder: open a private conversation from a lost phone report.

3
00:00:11,246 --> 00:00:17,306
The finder starts with 100 karma points.

4
00:00:17,306 --> 00:00:23,685
Verification shows the field labels. Saved proof values stay private.

5
00:00:23,685 --> 00:00:31,640
A one-character difference in each identifier fails verification.

6
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:37,857
The exact demo serial number and receipt code match.

7
00:00:37,857 --> 00:00:43,040
The finder confirms the phone was found. The return still needs the owner.

8
00:00:43,052 --> 00:00:48,058
Owner: open the same conversation in a separate browser session.

9
00:00:48,058 --> 00:00:53,799
Both people have confirmed. The owner can now acknowledge receipt.

10
00:00:53,799 --> 00:00:58,057
The owner confirms the physical handover.

11
00:00:58,057 --> 00:01:05,320
One MongoDB transaction marks the item returned and awards 50 points.

12
00:01:05,328 --> 00:01:10,754
Back in the finder session: the score went from 100 to 150.

13
00:01:10,754 --> 00:01:17,472
Replay the same authorized receipt request: no second return or award.

14
00:01:17,472 --> 00:01:23,160
150 → 150. Retrying returns the existing result without extra points.
